DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The nnppppppccttll utility controls the npppd(8) daemon.

     The options are as follows:

     --nn      Show IP addresses instead of their hostnames.

     --ss _s_o_c_k_e_t
             Use _s_o_c_k_e_t instead of the default _/_v_a_r_/_r_u_n_/_n_p_p_p_d_._s_o_c_k to communi‐
             cate with npppd(8).

     The following commands are available:

     cclleeaarr aallll | _f_i_l_t_e_r _._._.
             Disconnect PPP sessions.  If _f_i_l_t_e_r is specified, only matching
             PPP sessions are disconnected.  If aallll is specified, all PPP ses‐
             sions are disconnected.  See sseessssiioonn aallll for the types of _f_i_l_t_e_r.

     mmoonniittoorr aallll | _f_i_l_t_e_r _._._.
             Monitor start and stop of PPP sessions.  If _f_i_l_t_e_r is specified,
             only matching PPP sessions are monitored.  If aallll is specified,
             all PPP sessions are monitored.  See sseessssiioonn aallll for the types of
             _f_i_l_t_e_r.

     sseessssiioonn aallll [_f_i_l_t_e_r _._._.]
             Show detailed information for PPP sessions.  If _f_i_l_t_e_r is speci‐
             fied, only matching PPP sessions are shown; otherwise all PPP
             sessions are shown.  The following filters are available:

             aaddddrreessss _i_p___a_d_d_r_e_s_s
                     Show or clear PPP sessions whose IP address match
                     _i_p___a_d_d_r_e_s_s.

             iinntteerrffaaccee _i_n_t_e_r_f_a_c_e___n_a_m_e
                     Show or clear PPP sessions that use the interface speci‐
                     fied by _i_n_t_e_r_f_a_c_e___n_a_m_e.

             pppppp--iidd _i_d
                     Show or clear PPP sessions whose Ppp-Id match _i_d.

             pprroottooccooll _p_r_o_t_o_c_o_l
                     Show or clear PPP sessions that use the tunneling proto‐
                     col specified by _p_r_o_t_o_c_o_l.

             rreeaallmm _r_e_a_l_m___n_a_m_e
                     Show or clear PPP sessions whose realm match the speci‐
                     fied _r_e_a_l_m___n_a_m_e.

             uusseerrnnaammee _u_s_e_r_n_a_m_e
